# src/table/ — the SQLite mapping table, ALWAYS behind an endpoint (Seam C2,
# decision 5). Empty at M0: no sessions to map with zero components. Lands when
# the first component needs paneid -> server -> vendor -> agent -> session_id +
# state. Never let callers open the db file directly — endpoint indirection is
# what keeps the table's location a config flip, not a rewrite.
